# Welcome t'Norg (Zilart 2, mission.zilart.welcome_tnorg): _700 plays 2; its update on option 0 answers
# (252, 0, 1, MAX_UINT32 - 72454152, 66977791, 222376875, 4031, 4); its finish on option 0 completes the
# mission (no key item, no title; Kazham's Chieftainess current). Then _700 says DOOR_IS_LOCKED (10380, Norg's
# DefaultActions): The New Frontier is not completed here, so its section 2 does not answer.
lists Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/onEventUpdate/2 Norg/onEventFinish/2
char zone=Norg pos=98,-7,-12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart WelcomeTnorg current
login
trigger _700                            # 2
update 2 option=0                       # option 0: the update
finish option=0                         # option 0: completed
trigger _700                            # not current, The New Frontier not completed: DOOR_IS_LOCKED
